E7E_normal.jpg","text":"なんでWSLでこれが出るのかさっぱりわからない \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/FAXeWn7VQAED6lO.png\u003e","image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FAXeWn7VQAED6lO.png","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1632826192,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/kat0h/status/1442803738956099589"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WXfbq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8e422f68-a194-41d6-899a-a3c6fe0032bb","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"Deno1.14.2がリリースされたんですが、worker内worker(ddcソースとか)で例外飛ぶと死んでたのが直りました","ts":"1632839792.462100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"D8AT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eeec4e7e-0ca5-4327-858d-6a54978bdc36","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"ないす","ts":"1632839776.461700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fLb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4e1c40f4-d032-4088-b07e-e4d9d1cbc10f","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ｷﾀ━━━━ヽ(ﾟ∀ﾟ )ﾉ━━━━!!!! \u003chttps://github.com/denoland/deno/pull/12156\u003e","ts":"1632839756.461000","attachments":[{"color":"6f42c1","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/denoland/deno/pull/12156|#12156 fix(workers): Don't panic when a worker's parent thread stops running\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/denoland/deno/pull/12156|#12156 fix(workers): Don't panic when a worker's parent thread stops running\u003e","text":"This panic could happen in the following cases:\n\n• A non-fatal error being thrown from a worker, that doesn't terminate the worker's execution, but propagates to the main thread without being handled, and makes the main thread terminate.\n• A nested worker being alive while its parent worker gets terminated.\n• A race condition if the main event loop terminates the worker as part of its last task, but the worker doesn't fully terminate before the main event loop stops running.\n\nThis panic happens because a worker's event loop should have pending ops as long as the worker isn't closed or terminated – but if an event loop finishes running while it has living workers, its associated `WorkerThread` structs will be dropped, closing the channels that keep those ops pending.\n\nThis change adds a `Drop` implementation to `WorkerThread`, which terminates the worker without waiting for a response. This fixes the panic, and makes it so nested workers are automatically terminated once any of their ancestors is closed or terminated.\n\nThis change also refactors a worker's termination code into a `WorkerThread::terminate()` method.\n\nCloses #11342.","fields":[{"title":"Comments","value":"1","short":true}],"mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/denoland/deno|denoland/deno\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1632161891}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ipE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a351d562-d5c5-48b0-925e-8597d9a1958e","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"例のdenopsプレビュープラグインの目指す形だ","ts":"1632839301.459700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RVqw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"984fd74f-331c-4d57-bb09-86514daafb52","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"これとか他にもっとメンバー居ます！ｗ","ts":"1632839243.458800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NKC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"de815fcd-6c6a-4c34-b4d0-52a64044ec44","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/previm\u003e","ts":"1632839233.458400","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"Previm Developers","id":1,"title":"Previm Developers","thumb_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com